== Description ==

The '''Biochemical Workbench''' processes chemistry: gunpowder, explosives, medicines, and reagents. It defines 7 raw recipe entries (7 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Antibiotics]], [[Gunpowder]], [[Medical Bandage]], [[Medical Case]], [[Medkit]], [[Nitrate Powder]], [[Painkiller]].

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.BiochemicalWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Biochemical</code>.

